OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 5 APR
OL,4,G1945FWords and Music
OL,5,     GReadings from Natalie Simpson and
OL,6,     GRay Fearon on the transcendent
OL,7,     Gand numinous, from Shakespeare
OL,8,     Gand Donne to Wordsworth and
OL,9,     GLarkin. Music from Beethoven to
OL,10,     GBruckner.
OL,11,G2100FUltimate Calm with Erland Cooper
OL,12,     GScottish composer Erland Cooper
OL,13,     Gsits at the helm for this new
OL,14,     Gseries, starting simply in the
OL,15,     Grealm of sleep and dreams. Plus
OL,16,     Gwe visit the musical safe haven
OL,17,     Gof author Ian Rankin.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
